{"about_the_game":"Pack your bags and grab your passport!<br><br>You and your friends are going on a tasty trip around the world filled with chaos and laughter! Your favorite food characters are back in an even more epic and fun competition (now with a DASH action!)<br><br>Embark on this journey and welcome to Ultra Foodmess 2!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392000/extras/2e42256ae9371a154ea4bf285c23a101.poster.avif?t=1718134513\" width=616 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392000/extras/2e42256ae9371a154ea4bf285c23a101.webm?t=1718134513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392000/extras/2e42256ae9371a154ea4bf285c23a101.mp4?t=1718134513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392000/extras/c4b4be77e61680dfedeab94a680930c3.webp?t=1718134513\" width=58 height=58 /></span>ABOUT THE GAME</h2>Ultra Foodmess 2 brings back all the competitiveness of the first game, but now with a renewed look, new and chaotic game modes, in addition to several characters that are even more charismatic and fun.<br><br>Run, dash, shoot and push in this frantic party-game!<br><br>Play with up to 4 friends and select which modes around the world you want to battle, each one with its own crazy gameplay mechanics.<br><br>Fast, chaotic and fun, those are the words that define Ultra Foodmess 2, and you'll want to travel with your friends into this battle capable of providing hours of friendship-ruining fun.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392000/extras/01caad81c16fa112484e33c59d914d78.poster.avif?t=1718134513\" width=616 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392000/extras/01caad81c16fa112484e33c59d914d78.webm?t=1718134513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392000/extras/01caad81c16fa112484e33c59d914d78.mp4?t=1718134513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392000/extras/a1c5b29a991ff3db569f124d0b68ade5.webp?t=1718134513\" width=58 height=58 /></span>10 GAME MODES FILLED WITH CHAOS</h2>Face the unique challenges of each game mode as you travel the world! Each mode only lasts a few seconds, so you must be quick and attentive!<br><br>Collect and shoot donuts at your foes in Hollywood, play Foodball matches in Brazil, avoid deadly lasers in Japan and much more!<br>Each mode will surprise you in a new and delicious way!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392000/extras/12a6715b4bdd45c42c1e9ab1bd9f61c0.poster.avif?t=1718134513\" width=616 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392000/extras/12a6715b4bdd45c42c1e9ab1bd9f61c0.webm?t=1718134513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392000/extras/12a6715b4bdd45c42c1e9ab1bd9f61c0.mp4?t=1718134513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392000/extras/943c221543561c03ee15e3a5beaf9eee.webp?t=1718134513\" width=58 height=58 /></span> BATTLE AGAINST THE AI</h2>Don't have 4 friends to play with you? No problem! You can spice up your matches by adding Foodbots, an AI that will control your opponents.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392000/extras/c965057064a51726d472cf54ac3a9dbf.poster.avif?t=1718134513\" width=616 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392000/extras/c965057064a51726d472cf54ac3a9dbf.webm?t=1718134513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392000/extras/c965057064a51726d472cf54ac3a9dbf.mp4?t=1718134513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392000/extras/ab85e2bfaabec0d4457b20d4ea2dbab1.webp?t=1718134513\" width=58 height=58 /></span> CONTROL OPTIONS FOR EVERYONE</h2>Our goal is that you can play however you like with up to 4 friends! And thinking about it, you can use both keyboard and controllers!<br><br>Furthermore, Ultra Foodmess 2 also supports Remote Play! So invite your friends and get the party started!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392000/extras/14331bec2313c2b9be91e671b006e769.poster.avif?t=1718134513\" width=616 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392000/extras/14331bec2313c2b9be91e671b006e769.webm?t=1718134513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392000/extras/14331bec2313c2b9be91e671b006e769.mp4?t=1718134513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392000/extras/98fc68e4e339401e50c3122694747f65.webp?t=1718134513\" width=58 height=58 /></span> UNLOCKABLES!</h2>Play matches to earn experience and unlock awesome new characters!<br><br>Play as classic characters like Sandy and Barry or be amazed at the new foods that have joined the gang!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392000/extras/0cfceed288369e732e4abe32d4e08adb.avif?t=1718134513\" width=616 height=1278 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Triple dash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2392000/b1673d74b338121cacf6c9a332af10b542b502d0.jpg"},{"name":"Poo-rfect Place","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2392000/45718a623c530d28e397edb132605eda71b3340b.jpg"},{"name":"Marathonist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2392000/d8df8a3580675586c382602c1d8783e6a7aeb6de.jpg"},{"name":"First Snack","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2392000/a806afa026bb7529e39ecd94232fee26782262b0.jpg"},{"name":"Brunch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2392000/971ceb5acf9c5e2cb66bb46a453d9495cbaa2f8c.jpg"},{"name":"Full Course Meal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2392000/a027c107f36380ed27bc786b6cdfce8d3c3c2257.jpg"},{"name":"Cottagecore","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2392000/6668ba95a88906caa86d3774337cc090147f7cd8.jpg"},{"name":"Blossom Bandit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2392000/a4a9663611b61d0be43d3f42cddd4574ecd1231a.jpg"},{"name":"Symphony Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2392000/e9f6472a0e9a30970f9da9bb6aa3babba7af45d6.jpg"},{"name":"Close Call","path":"https://c